  "title": "Today’s Subject HeeJin (희진) at Music Lab [DJ Ashley's Radio' Clock]",
  "description": "감기 기운 때문에 라이브를 듣지 못해서 아쉽지만,🥲 그래도 너무 즐거운 시간이었던 희진🐰과의 시간이었습니다😍\n\n라이브를 못해서 아쉬운 마음만큼, 노래가 나갈 때 보여준 포인트 안무와 그리고 예쁘고 귀여운 팬들을 위한 손글씨까지✍️ 보여주고 갔는데요❣️\n\nK를 대표하는 노래가 될 때까지! 💫\nK를 대표하는 가수가 될 때까지! ✨️\n아프지 말고, 건강하게 활동해 주세요🍀\n\nEven though we couldn't listen to the live performance of HeeJin due to a cold, it was still a really fun time! 🐰😍\nShe showed off the point choreography and she even wrote the cute handwriting for the fans✍️❣️️\nPlease don’t get sick and be healthy, HeeJin🍀\n\n\n▶Subscribe Arirang Radio: https://www.youtube.com/Music180Arirang\n——————————————————————————————\nThe first English broadcasting radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day\n#HeeJin #희진 #Algorithm #ARTMS #아르테미스",
